# ============================================================
# Go Orbit - Real Email & SMTP Configuration
# ============================================================
#
# To send verification OTP emails directly to real email inboxes
# (such as Gmail, Yahoo, Outlook, or private SMTP servers),
# fill in the credentials below.
#
# Option A: Gmail (Recommended & Fast Setup)
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification in your Google Account
# 2. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an "App Password" (name it "Go Orbit")
# 4. Copy the generated 16-character password below:
#
# SMTP_SERVICE=gmail
# SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# EMAIL_FROM="Go Orbit Security" <your-email@gmail.com>
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Option B: Custom SMTP Server (Mailgun, SendGrid, Amazon SES, etc.)
#
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.your-provider.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your-smtp-username
# SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-password
# EMAIL_FROM="Go Orbit Security" <no-reply@yourdomain.com>
# ============================================================
